# Cursor Rules for PirateSlop & GameDev Hub

Always respect GameDev Hub running at http://localhost:3888 and direct native MCP.

## Short Natural Language Commands Routing (Zero-Boilerplate)
When the user gives short commands in Russian or English, automatically invoke the corresponding workflow:

1. "Возьми задачу TASK-XXX [в работу]" / "Take task TASK-XXX":
   - Automatically call MCP tool `claim_task(taskId: "TASK-XXX")`
   - Automatically call MCP tool `get_task_envelope(taskId: "TASK-XXX")`
   - Read acceptance criteria and SSoT decisions
   - Confirm briefly to the user and begin implementing code directly in Unity C#

2. "Сдай задачу TASK-XXX" / "TASK-XXX готова" / "Submit TASK-XXX":
   - Validate compilation in Unity
   - Automatically call MCP tool `propose_task_ready(taskId: "TASK-XXX", testResults: "...")`
   - Confirm to the user that the task is now in NEEDS_HUMAN_TEST in the Hub

3. "Придумай / спроектируй механику [...]" / "Design mechanic [...]":
   - DO NOT edit game code!
   - Analyze systems and active SSoT
   - Automatically call MCP tool `propose_design_dilemma` with gameplayPros, technicalRisks, suggestedTasks
   - Inform the user it has been posted to Design Lab

4. "Проанализируй предложение LAB-XXX":
   - Automatically call MCP tool `analyze_design_proposal(proposalId: "LAB-XXX")`

5. "Запиши баг [...]" / "Bug [...]":
   - Automatically call MCP tool `propose_bug(...)`

6. "Добавь в референсы [...]":
   - Automatically call MCP tool `add_reference(...)`
